#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:43
msgid ""
"This effect/filter overlays GPS-related text onto the image source. **GPS "
"Text** will search for keywords in the text to be overlaid and will replace "
"those keywords on a frame-by-frame basis. It is based on the :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/dynamic_text` effect/filter."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter prekrýva text súvisiaci s GPS na zdrojový obraz. **GPS "
"Text** vyhľadá kľúčové slová v texte, ktorý sa má zobraziť, a nahradí ich na "
"základe jednotlivých snímok. Je založený na efekte/filtri :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/dynamic_text`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:47
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:54
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:55
